  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">El club Estrella Blanca de Las Quemas de Chuyaquén obtuvo el tercer lugar a nivel nacional en el Campeonato FEM–FENFUR Panguipulli 2026, tras imponerse por 4–1 a Chiloé Unido de Dalcahue.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Felicitamos a las jugadoras y al cuerpo técnico por su esfuerzo, compromiso y entrega, dejando en alto el nombre de la comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fuente:munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-55 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3272\" data-id=\"3272\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ondlkuy1ansx6la/5cb85451_28bc_4353_977d_c2c2adaf5d55_1_1024x558_ch0ph9u8tc.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3273\" data-id=\"3273\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/3jg6p68pbdv2b8c/846accae_986c_4409_861e_d691268e8ef1_1024x700_hgquj6lvow.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3275\" data-id=\"3275\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/6jxupoxeb3io32j/d0cf6c69_737f_4851_98fb_4c91c93972f7_682x1024_tv38azyn4e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3274\" data-id=\"3274\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"